    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just keep thinking that if i wasn't here, everything would just... snap back to normal for them. they could finally breathe. they could go back to being the person they were before i ruined everything. it feels like the only way i can actually do something good for them is to just stop being such a burden. like, if i'm just gone, they can finally have their life back.",
